OL,3,ATrump says summit with Xi and Putin in
OL,4,AChina is 'making history'
OL,5,
OL,6,FDonald Trump calls Vladimir Putin his
OL,7,F"friend" and says they have a "great
OL,8,Frelationship" before they hold a
OL,9,Fmeeting with China's President Xi in
OL,10,FShenzhen
OL,12,FTrump held separate, bilateral meetings
OL,13,Fwith Putin and Xi before the three-way
OL,14,Ftalks, which are under way now
OL,16,FAt the start of the meeting, Xi says
OL,17,Fthe talks have "groundbreaking
OL,18,Fsignificance" - Trump says they are
OL,19,F"really making history"
OL,23,APub: 19-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
